**Title:** Whispering Waves of Quiet Bravery

**Description:** Drift into a serene slumber with the gentle story of Oliver, an eleven-year-old boy with a heart full of quiet bravery. Accompanied by his playful otter friend, Fin, Oliver embarks on a tranquil journey along a coastal shoreline bathed in the soft glow of twilight. As the ocean hums its lullaby, Oliver discovers the magic of quiet confidence and the soothing power of nature's embrace. This peaceful tale is crafted to ease your mind, reduce anxiety, and guide you gently into the comforting arms of sleep. Let the whispering waves and the calm presence of Oliver and Fin lull you into a realm of dreams and tranquility.

